## Third-party components

Components bundled in this repository are licensed separately and are **not**
covered by the terms above. Their own licence terms govern their use, and they
are listed in [`docs/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`](docs/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).

In particular:

- This project is built with the **Godot Engine**, which is MIT-licensed.
  See <https://godotengine.org/license>.
- **Terrain3D** is bundled under `addons/terrain_3d/` and carries its own MIT
  licence at [`addons/terrain_3d/LICENSE.txt`](addons/terrain_3d/LICENSE.txt).

## History of this file

Until 2026-09-23 this path held an unrelated third party's MIT licence
(`Copyright (c) 2023 mohsenph69`, the author of the Godot-MTerrain addon), which
arrived in commit `5496269` alongside terrain experiments and was never
replaced. It was never an intentional licence grant for this project. See
issue #5.
